 intro="Clouds, sunshine and breeze are all products of the blanket of air around the Earth. This chapter covers what the atmosphere is made of, how it is layered, how weather differs from climate, the seasons and monsoon of India, climate change, and the 2025 Punjab floods as a case study.",
